        "id": 94287,
        "name": "Reckless",
        "username": "Reckless",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/reckless/{size}/2467_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-03-01T09:43:04.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>It doesn't have to be reduced.&nbsp; Damage just has to be dealt to Omnitron-X.&nbsp; Whether it's at least 3 regular damage or 1 or more irreducible damage of the Plating's type, the Reactive Plating Subroutine will trigger.</p>",
