        "id": 94289,
        "name": "Foote",
        "username": "Foote",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/foote/{size}/1877_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-03-01T14:46:18.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>A few things here, just to clarify.&nbsp;</p><p>1) the damage dealt must share a damage type with your current plating</p><p>2) you must actually take some damage for subroutine to trigger.&nbsp;</p><p>Example: you have elemental chassis out and Set deals you 2 lightning damage. Now, the condition for 1 was met (matching types), but since omniX would take no damage (2-2=0), subroutine would not trigger. &nbsp;</p>",
        "post_number": 4,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T03:20:46.538Z",
