        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ameena/{size}/1907_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-03-01T15:02:55.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>And this is why I like Omni-10 against Rat, because you get out your RPS and Ablative Coating, and then you're guaranteed to plink Rat automatically at the end of his turn, every turn, and if you're Infected, at the start of your own turn, every turn. Counter the damage (mostly) by getting out both Innervation Rays and you can whittle him down pretty nicely :).</p>",
